// IMPLEMENTATION STEPS:
// 1. Copy the JSON object below (without these comments) into a new file
//    named .vscode/auto_login.json — it must live directly in .vscode/
//    (not a subfolder) and be plain JSON, since comments aren't valid
//    JSON and --dart-define-from-file will fail to parse them.
// 2. Replace "login-phone-number" and "login-password" with your actual
//    auto-login credentials. auto_login.json is gitignored, so it never
//    gets committed.
// 3. Point any launch config's toolArgs at it with:
//      --dart-define-from-file=.vscode/auto_login.json
//    ("Flutter: Run Dev" already does this) — or pass the same flag when
//    running from the terminal:
//      flutter run --dart-define-from-file=.vscode/auto_login.json
{
    "AUTO_PHONE": "login-phone-number",
    "AUTO_PASSWORD": "login-password"
}